#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit.pulse.builder.cx`\n"
msgstr "`qiskit.pulse.builder.cx`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit.pulse.builder.u1`\n"
msgstr "`qiskit.pulse.builder.u1`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit.pulse.builder.u2`\n"
msgstr "`qiskit.pulse.builder.u2`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit.pulse.builder.u3`\n"
msgstr "`qiskit.pulse.builder.u3`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit.pulse.builder.x`\n"
msgstr "`qiskit.pulse.builder.x`\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you still want to inject backend-calibrated schedules, use the following\n"
"pattern instead of calling gate commands.\n"
msgstr ""
"Se você ainda quiser injetar schedules calibrados pelo backend, use o seguinte\n"
"padrão em vez de chamar comandos de gate.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Similarly, a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) can\n"
"be injected in the builder context by manually transpiling and scheduling the\n"
"object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Da mesma forma, um [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit) pode\n"
"ser injetado no contexto do builder transpilando e agendando manualmente o\n"
"objeto.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend writing a minimum pulse program with the builder and attaching it to\n"
"`QuantumCircuit` through the\n"
"[`QuantumCircuit.add_calibration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#add_calibration)\n"
"method as a microcode of a gate instruction, rather than writing the entire\n"
"program with the pulse model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Recomendamos escrever um programa de pulso mínimo com o builder e anexá-lo ao\n"
"`QuantumCircuit` por meio do método\n"
"[`QuantumCircuit.add_calibration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/1.4/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#add_calibration)\n"
"como microcode de uma instrução de gate, em vez de escrever todo o\n"
"programa com o modelo de pulso.\n"

